WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.763
Welcome.

2
00:00:00.763 --> 00:00:04.647
This is the executive briefing
on external partner identity,

3
00:00:04.647 --> 00:00:09.218
from the HR-Driven Identity book of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

4
00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:12.799
with its partner access profile
in Access and Privilege.

5
00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:17.585
It's for the people who make the calls:
the CIO and CISO, the business owners of

6
00:00:17.585 --> 00:00:22.750
programs shared with partners, the privacy
officer and the authorizing official.

7
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.625
Many people who sign in to agency
systems work for someone else.

8
00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:30.225
The workbook now treats them
as their own identity class.

9
00:00:30.225 --> 00:00:33.355
I'll take four questions:
why the class exists,

10
00:00:33.355 --> 00:00:36.738
what it is, who decides,
and how a partner goes live.

11
00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:39.290
The last slide gathers the decisions.
